Description:
	This directory has various subdirectoris containing algorithms
	for robotics, especially motion planning.

	Subdirectory 3d-sphere:
	This is a 3d adapation of $(corelib)/progs/robotics/2d-disk.

Author:
	Xinwei Lin (2013).

